<title>SWITZERLAND: Japan blocks WTO panel in Fuji-Kodak dispute.</title>
<headline>Japan blocks WTO panel in Fuji-Kodak dispute.</headline>
<dateline>GENEVA 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan on Thursday blocked immediate creation of a World Trade Organisation panel to look into the Fuji Photo Film Co /Eastman Kodak dispute over access to Japan's photo-film market, trade diplomats said.</p>
<p>But creation of the panel, which will have six months to return its findings, will be automatic at the next meeting of the WTO's Dispute Settlement Body on October 16. --Geneva newsroom -- 41-22-733-38-31</p>
</text>
